<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">voice-amber-housing</ansi> (jewelcrafting recipe)

A jeweler's housing of deep-set amber, faceted and warm, shaped with a
hollow built to cradle something small that will not stop talking. Hold
it to your ear and you can just hear the murmur trapped inside, muffled
by the amber but never quite silenced. It was built to listen as much as
to hold -- a housing that keeps its passenger close and its voice
closer.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       jewelcrafting (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     jeweler_bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Polished Stone (x2), Gold Wire (x1), Gem Dust (x1)

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help jewelcrafting</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
